    caret-provider-wrappers, bootstrap, false, automated, "sh scripts/check/check-caret-suite-bootstrap.shs --gate provider-wrappers", -, -, "Stage4-bound injected-command argv and process lifecycle fixture contracts for Claude Codex Gemini and Kimi; not installed-provider proof"
